        "chapter": 6,
        "verse": 4
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "then it shall be, if he has sinned, and is guilty, he shall restore that which he took by robbery, or the thing which he has gotten by oppression, or the deposit which was committed to him, or the lost thing which he found,",
      "ko": "이는 죄를 범하였고 죄가 있는 자니 그 빼앗은 것이나 늑봉한 것이나 맡은 것이나 얻은 유실물이나",
      "source_text_hash": "a0eb975c40d125804acfc4a58de3e3b9e48a477a0fa518c69312afd810b38e5b",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d9a07ef34700aee05fad596aa7f79c3abb8f278d380359f250aecb42f7e869c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이는 죄를 범하였고 죄가 있는 자니 그 빼앗은 것이나 늑봉한 것이나 맡은 것이나 얻은 유실물이나"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0d9a07ef34700aee05fad596aa7f79c3abb8f278d380359f250aecb42f7e869c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:6:5",
      "sequence": 2855,
      "chapter_label": "LEV 6",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
        "book": "LEV",
        "chapter": 6,
        "verse": 5
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "or any thing about which he has sworn falsely: he shall restore it in full, and shall add a fifth part more to it. He shall return it to him to whom it belongs in the day of his being found guilty.",
      "ko": "무릇 그 거짓 맹세한 물건을 돌려 보내되 곧 그 본물에 오분 일을 더하여 돌려 보낼 것이니 그 죄가 드러나는 날에 그 임자에게 줄 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "1a61f1f6aa57478f4019c3a9a49ad613f7d127736086360005a39ecad406bfb2",
      "translation_text_hash": "9fadf69f9e4f4d93b0f4de736beb99ece8e88ccc163b59bcc09c1c1a7076d8d1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "무릇 그 거짓 맹세한 물건을 돌려 보내되 곧 그 본물에 오분 일을 더하여 돌려 보낼 것이니 그 죄가 드러나는 날에 그 임자에게 줄 것이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9fadf69f9e4f4d93b0f4de736beb99ece8e88ccc163b59bcc09c1c1a7076d8d1"
