      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "The priest shall make atonement for him before the LORD, and he will be forgiven concerning whatever he does to become guilty.”",
      "ko": "제사장은 여호와 앞에서 그를 위하여 속죄한즉 그는 무슨 허물이든지 사함을 얻으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "238233f603e916e680edfb53fff7922dcbf659a941d0fedc4f739cb8008a244d",
      "translation_text_hash": "46387461c052f7b23d19deb580fff1446e94e2ab286a8490b1091891188d08f4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
