      "en": "Fire shall be kept burning on the altar continually; it shall not go out.",
      "ko": "불은 끊이지 않고 단 위에 피워 꺼지지 않게 할찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "cd588873eb0aa7b509ec619c4c276daacd8edc57d350524f497d80aa438b5298",
      "translation_text_hash": "f1bd9ed27fa5e9fca4c5f49167160a4974d2d83934c7f489a8dc3d8331abd91a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
