      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "That which is left of it Aaron and his sons shall eat. It shall be eaten without yeast in a holy place. They shall eat it in the court of the Tent of Meeting.",
      "ko": "그 나머지는 아론과 그 자손이 먹되 누룩을 넣지 말고 거룩한 곳 회막 뜰에서 먹을찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ce97a7cd91f9aa4f28541cf7469be78016a27b248a8f9f96da01c16600459e81",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1382bbc28e894c1c1da5eac483976df4046b4452e6fe5c45f3fc578c7dc4949",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 나머지는 아론과 그 자손이 먹되 누룩을 넣지 말고 거룩한 곳 회막 뜰에서 먹을찌니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e1382bbc28e894c1c1da5eac483976df4046b4452e6fe5c45f3fc578c7dc4949"
      ]
    },
    {
