      "en": "The priest who offers it for sin shall eat it. It shall be eaten in a holy place, in the court of the Tent of Meeting.",
      "ko": "죄를 위하여 제사드리는 제사장이 그것을 먹되 곧 회막 뜰 거룩한 곳에서 먹을 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "6ac4c757ffa5f7d802ded198e3ea2ac9ebc4037eb31360912159588e5effa2ad",
      "translation_text_hash": "7c8971254104c0c85f923ff62b7fc88739eeda54e1be87323c7e09d6eabdda93",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
